# The desktop shell is its own workspace, so its target directory is not covered by the
# entry above. A 140 MB debug binary in a commit is rejected by the remote, and the fix has to
# be an amend rather than a follow-up delete: the blob stays in history either way.
desktop/target/
# Regenerated by tauri-build on every build.
desktop/gen/schemas/
